CALLIN6 ATTENTION NOTICE
5. MS. NAEEMA KISHWER KHAN MS. ALIYA KAMRANMR. MUHAMMAD USMAN BADINI MS. SHAHIDA BEGUM to inviteattention of the Minister for National Health Services, Regulations and Coordination, toa matter of urgent public importance regarding the emergence of new polio cases in thecountry, causing grave concern amongst the public.
